 "notes": "Tier shelf; no archetypes. Dropped: Acova TAG/Vuelta and Reina Odet (plumbed designer radiators, Home Fixtures, not portable oil-filled); Broan 163 built-in bathroom heater (fixture); Dyson Purifier range on fan heater (purifiers live in Air purifiers); old Dyson 'Hot + Cool HF1' (not confirmed on any retrieved page); three of five Heat Storm SKUs. Infrared heat lamp merged into Radiant heater as a type; flueless kind split into Kerosene heater and Portable gas heater (Bromic, Mr. Heater moved there). Micathermic and panel are types of Convector heater. Not added for lack of a retrieved confirming page: Stiebel Eltron, Mill convector, Vornado, Honeywell, Lasko heater models beyond 5586; Könighaus and Trotec infrared panels; Duraflame and Dimplex Stockbridge electric stoves (retailer pages blocked); Campingaz heaters; Sengoku current models. Which?, Stiftung Warentest and Consumer Reports winners are paywalled or not found; tier lists use Which? tested models, Popular Science, Expert Reviews, Mumsnet, The Eco Experts and nlab (Japan) picks. Brands Vornado and Stiebel Eltron were fetched (Wikipedia) but given no register entry here as no shelf model uses them."
